  "cover_text": "Well it's been a funny few days. On Saturday we are doing the same thing I would like: opening the quilt myself. I did this as part of the Healing with Pockets booklet, namely with pages 38 -42.\nI needed to make the quilt brown, but in the end did not make the best of it. I got lucky though. I knew brown is the colour and got myself to the quilt.\nWe made the two quilts outside. I am so thrilled that both quilts went into their final form at the end of Saturday. Well done, Rebecca",
